can fully control them. Helga is awe-inspiring in Erectus, where magic is less developed, and her subordinates are all monsters."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c96530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f8b960989c0738ced24bf5057ed31bcf8e047bfd385bda555f9cc8123c963f3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/729180580f3b31cf0e39cddae304297f28a325c086a2225400a74ea370cf88f8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉原 茉莉","creatorId":"vndb:s879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s879","name":"水口 まつり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15801","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c96531","characterName":"ゲオルグ・ヨアヒム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c96531"},"originalCharacterName":"ゲオルグ・ヨアヒム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Georg is a Magic Weapon researcher for the Erectus army. He has done a lot of inhumane research using monsters and sorcerers. He also tends to attack neighboring villages that happen to be in the vicinity of the battlefield. He follows Blanche for some reason."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c96531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/348f961d86e0c8d9a034d4e659548d3077939fb70d648a5b48f69928d7af3e1b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/880637c81a449fd713708b129d02c010f74d8696ca0b97d092131bd08c8d7711.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"credi